# ai-memory-kit — repo-local ignores
# This kit is the SOURCE of the templates; it has no runtime state of its own.

# Local agent/runtime state that must never be committed (regenerable).
.atl/
.codegraph/
*.log
*.tgz
node_modules/

# NOTE: a project's own `.engram/` sync chunks are intentionally COMMITTED
# in the projects that consume this kit. They are not ignored there.
